#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:840
msgid ""
"--- YOUR CERTIFICATE OF COMPLETION ---\n"
"Tab to the Export Certificate button below and press Enter.\n"
"Your certificate will open in your web browser.\n"
"\n"
"To save or print your certificate:\n"
"  1. In your browser, press Ctrl+S to save the page, or press Ctrl+P to print it.\n"
"  2. To print to PDF, choose 'Save as PDF' or 'Microsoft Print to PDF' as your printer.\n"
"  3. A copy is also saved automatically to your Downloads folder."
msgstr ""
"--- 您的结业证书 ---\n"
"请按 Tab 找到下面的“导出证书”按钮并按回车键。\n"
"证书会在浏览器中打开。\n"
"\n"
"要保存或打印证书：\n"
"  1. 在浏览器中按 Ctrl+S 保存页面，或按 Ctrl+P 打印。\n"
"  2. 要打印为 PDF，请在打印机中选择“另存为 PDF”或“Microsoft Print to PDF”。\n"
"  3. 证书副本也会自动保存到“下载”文件夹。"

