#: globalPlugins/nvdaCoach/__init__.py:888
msgid ""
"You have completed all six chapters of NVDA Coach. Your progress is saved and your certificate of completion is ready.\n"
"\n"
"--- YOUR CERTIFICATE ---\n"
"Tab to the Export Certificate of Completion button below and press Enter to open your certificate in your web browser. A copy is also saved to your Downloads folder automatically.\n"
"\n"
"--- CONTINUE LEARNING ---\n"
"Press NVDA+Shift+C to open the lesson picker. You can revisit any lesson at any time to review commands and practice.\n"
"\n"
"--- LESSON NAVIGATION ---\n"
"  Ctrl+N  —  Next lesson in the current category\n"
"  Ctrl+B  —  Previous lesson\n"
"  Ctrl+R  —  Restart the current lesson\n"
"\n"
"--- QUICK KEYS ---\n"
"  F4 — Open help documentation\n"
"  F5 — Send feedback to the developer\n"
"  F6 — Toggle lesson sounds on or off\n"
"  F7 — Update your profile (name, instructor, training center)"
msgstr ""
"您已经完成 NVDA Coach 的全部六个章节。您的进度已保存，结业证书已准备就绪。\n"
"\n"
"--- 您的证书 ---\n"
"请按 Tab 找到下面的“导出结业证书”按钮并按回车键，在浏览器中打开证书。副本也会自动保存到“下载”文件夹。\n"
"\n"
"--- 继续学习 ---\n"
"按 NVDA+Shift+C 打开课程选择器。您可以随时回到任意课程，复习命令并继续练习。\n"
"\n"
"--- 课程导航 ---\n"
"  Ctrl+N  —  当前章节的下一课\n"
"  Ctrl+B  —  上一课\n"
"  Ctrl+R  —  重新开始当前课程\n"
"\n"
"--- 快捷键 ---\n"
"  F4 — 打开帮助文档\n"
"  F5 — 向开发者发送反馈\n"
"  F6 — 开启或关闭课程声音\n"
"  F7 — 更新个人资料（姓名、指导老师、培训中心）"

